# .ignoreVuln — Vulnerability IDs accepted as residual risk
#
# One OSV / pip-audit vulnerability ID per line. Lines starting with `#`
# and empty lines are ignored.
#
# Each Python service `build.sh` reads this file and passes every entry
# as a `--ignore-vuln ID` flag to pip-audit.
#
# When dropping an entry: confirm the patched release is on PyPI and
# pip-resolves above the previous vulnerable version. Then re-run the
# service's `./build.sh` to verify the gate stays green without the flag.
#
# Review on every dependency bump — entries here are exceptions, not
# permanent bypasses.

# lightning (transitive via pyannote.audio)
# Upstream fix committed (commit d710d68, 2026-07-14) but no PyPI
# release yet as of 2026-08-30. CVSS 8.4 local; requires a planted
# malicious .ckpt triggering LightningModule.load_from_checkpoint,
# which LifeLog does not load from any untrusted path. Drop this
# entry when lightning>=2.6.6 is on PyPI and pyannote.audio resolves
# to it.
PYSEC-2026-3624

# nltk (transitive via whisperx / transcription-worker)
# Path traversal in model-artifact APIs (CVE-2026-81726 / PYSEC-2026-3740).
# Affects NLTK <= 3.10.3. No fixed release on PyPI yet (3.10.3 is latest
# as of 2026-09-02). Attack requires attacker-controlled resource name in
# nltk.data.load/find — LifeLog loads only trusted bundled data. Drop this
# entry when nltk>=3.10.4 is released and resolves the vulnerability.
PYSEC-2026-3740
